{"id":"n83747-2-7","stage":2,"title":"품 · 胸前","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n83747-2-7-1","ko":"품에 끼고 있는 것은 뭐야?","zh":"你怀里抱着的是什么呀？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"품에","meaning":"胸前，怀里","explanation":"품：胸前，怀里；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"품","audio":"/audio/c2fa9dd227de1178187c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83747","senseId":"2","lemma":"품","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"품에","audio":"/audio/054d81dfbe3adc7fa5c2.mp3"}},{"text":"끼고","meaning":"插，夹，掖","explanation":"끼다：插，夹，掖；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"끼다","audio":"/audio/62c9da6515c8237ff0f1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61097","senseId":"1","lemma":"끼다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"끼고","audio":"/audio/9f3112402d255d7d87e7.mp3"}},{"text":"있는","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있는","audio":"/audio/9714c770db7ebcb9f4f1.mp3"}},{"text":"것은","meaning":"东西，事，的","explanation":"것：东西，事，的；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"1","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것은","audio":"/audio/66faf3bab33879865298.mp3"}},{"text":"뭐야?","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐야","audio":"/audio/4ec8ab9dc5310ffa76e8.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c2fa9dd227de1178","term":"품","zh":"胸前，怀里","audio":"/audio/c2fa9dd227de1178187c.mp3","entryId":"83747","definition":"穿着上衣时胸部和衣服之间的缝隙。","